rooms_desc ({"The harmony and peace feels this hall.You thing the rest here will be a very good think,so you start the meditation enjoying the marvellious sights trought the windowsSomething smells very good from the eastern room.You feel some mistery behind	the northern door.You can see an interesting picture on the souther wall.When you investigate it,","On the wall around you can see many weapons.Sharp swords;deadly spears;flashing shurikens and other killer items hangs around.Seeing this arsenal you think Jade is a very deadly warrior and you must beblessed,becouse you can be a friend of Jade.","When you look around you see a very professional kitchen.There is a modernowen,a bid table,chairs and before the eastern wall a very very big cupboard.The source of interesting smells are few soucepans.So you think Jade must be a very good cook (may be better then fighter),and  you hope Jade will invite you for dinner.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"You are standing the peacefull hall of Jade's house.","This is Jade's secret weapon-room.","You entered the kitchen.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
